1
00:00:03,737 --> 00:00:07,507
(Leonard:)I don't know why I avoided the Harry Potter
books for so long. These are great.

2
00:00:07,707 --> 00:00:10,797
(Leonard:)- I just started number six.
- That's a good one.

3
00:00:11,011 --> 00:00:12,531
(Sheldon:)Dumbledore dies in that one.

4
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:18,439
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I know, I didn't see it coming, either.

5
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:20,919
(Leonard:)Why would you say that?

6
00:00:21,121 --> 00:00:24,521
You brought up a subject,
I contributed a fact on that subject.

7
00:00:24,724 --> 00:00:27,884
(Sheldon:)It's called the art of conversation.
Okay, your turn.

8
00:00:29,829 --> 00:00:31,529
(Leonard:)That was a huge spoiler.

9
00:00:31,731 --> 00:00:33,321
(Sheldon:)Good.

10
00:00:34,234 --> 00:00:38,394
(Leonard:)What is wrong with you?
If I did that, you'd bitch about it for weeks.

11
00:00:38,605 --> 00:00:40,935
(Sheldon:)Really, Leonard?
Gonna have one of your hissy fits?

12
00:00:41,474 --> 00:00:43,104
(Leonard:)Hissy fits? I have hissy fits?

13
00:00:43,343 --> 00:00:45,873
(Sheldon:)Yes. And I have a theory why.

14
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:50,209
(Sheldon:)Because of your lactose intolerance,
you switched over to soy milk.

15
00:00:50,417 --> 00:00:53,747
(Sheldon:)Soy contains estrogen-mimicking
compounds.

16
00:00:53,953 --> 00:01:03,023
(Sheldon:)I think your morning Cocoa Puffs
are turning you into a hysterical woman.

